From b993108d6eded146825632335c73755ca2921aff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:49:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/15] perf(pfm): stop resending unchanged finished stove
 items

With foodPopsOffStove disabled, a finished stove or stovetop item without
a campfire recipe was stored again and sent to every tracking player with
a block update and full block-entity NBT on every tick. Skip only that
identical store and its update; the lookup, conversions, the pop-off
branch and setChanged are unchanged.

The fix runs in the server tick, so the mod now loads on both sides. The
existing compatibility configs stay client-only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
